IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FLEX-ATTENTION.

DATA DIVISION.
01 ROWS-COUNT          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 COLS-COUNT          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SKIPPED-COUNT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPARSITY-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
01 SPEEDUP-RATIO-X100  PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FLEX-ATTN.
    IF ROWS-COUNT == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE SPARSITY-PCT = (SKIPPED-COUNT * 100) / (ROWS-COUNT * COLS-COUNT).
    COMPUTE SPEEDUP-RATIO-X100 = 100 + (SPARSITY-PCT * 125 / 100).

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SPEEDUP-RATIO-X100.
    WEIGHT 30 SPARSITY-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
